<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine Central Bank selling dlrs-traders.</title>
<headline>Philippine Central Bank selling dlrs-traders.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Central Bank sold about $40-50 million at 26.275 pesos in early trade on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>It renewed its selling because foreign funds, which sold heavily in the the local equities market, are still taking their money out, dealers said.</p>
</text>
